## ContestsApi

### List contest effects
## List contest effects
GET https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/contest-effect/?limit={{limit}}&offset={{offset}}&q={{q}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Basic: {{username-password}}
Cookie: sessionid={{cookieKey}}

### Get contest effect
## Get contest effect
GET https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/contest-effect/{{id}}/
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Basic: {{username-password}}
Cookie: sessionid={{cookieKey}}

